    owl:unionOf ( <http://w3id.org/lambda/rocrate/ControlSystemEnum#epics> <http://w3id.org/lambda/rocrate/ControlSystemEnum#tango> <http://w3id.org/lambda/rocrate/ControlSystemEnum#labview> <http://w3id.org/lambda/rocrate/ControlSystemEnum#opi> ) ;
