    owl:unionOf ( <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHMO_0000156> <http://w3id.org/lambda/rocrate/ExperimentalMethodEnum#neutron_diffraction> <http://w3id.org/lambda/rocrate/ExperimentalMethodEnum#electron_diffraction> <http://w3id.org/lambda/rocrate/ExperimentalMethodEnum#fiber_diffraction> ) ;
